  "description": "The LINQ Promenade is a shopping, dining and entertainment district located at the center of the Las Vegas Strip which is home to 35+ restaurant and retail stores such as Brooklyn Bowl, Gordon Ramsay Fish and Chips, IN-N-Out Burger, Yard House, and so much more! You can find exciting attractions at The LINQ Promenade such as The High Roller, North America's Tallest Observation wheel, and Fly LINQ Zipline, the strip's only zipline. There's something for everyone at The LINQ Promenade!",
